        {
          "text": "I groan inwardly. People never can resist seeing a car accident up close. Always annoying",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 77
        },
        {
          "text": "I have seen every kind of death during my too-long existence. I was on the front lines of the Spanish influenza, a time ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 239
