    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We are trained to handle scenes like the one before me dispassionately. Most of the time I manage it just fine. For the ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 599
        },
        {
          "text": "Lucy McKenzie is—was—even younger than I had been when I died. Her death—unlike mine—is a tragedy",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 898
        }
      ],
      "words": 73
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "If it weren’t for this bus, she would have lived to a very old age. Or so my supervisor told me when they assigned me he",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1098
        },
        {
          "text": "But I can’t think about that now",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1225
        },
        {
          "text": "I have work to do",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1258
        },
        {
          "text": "Only I’m finding it difficult to focus",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1277
        },
        {
          "text": "But Ms. McKenzie’s soul is so brilliant I could have found her anywhere. Not just a bright flash against the gloom, but ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1409
        }
      ],
      "words": 81
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I am a professional agent of death, not a gawking bystander like the idiots all around us",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1722
        },
        {
          "text": "Everything that made her her clings tightly to her soul, resisting my insistent tugs with everything she once was",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2297
        },
        {
          "text": "I see a sister she adores. A sketchbook she used to carry everywhere but abandoned years ago. Happy family vacations to ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2503
        },
        {
          "text": "This time, however—despite my best efforts—I can’t look away",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2817
        },
        {
          "text": "I close my eyes when I urge her, gently, to let go",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2878
        }
